    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρυσταλλο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like ice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.45U.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				19.21
			</span></i>; v.l. for -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώδης</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.6.6
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					2.11.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>like crystal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰασπίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.142
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὑγρόν</span> the
				<i>crystalline lens</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				153
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				8.5
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. χιτών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.71
				</span></i>
			: Astron., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ.</span> the
				<i>crystalline sphere,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Placit.
				2.14.3
			</span></i>.</div>
